stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> RECEIVED
  RECEIVED --> VERIFIED: raw transport checks pass
  RECEIVED --> REJECTED_SECURITY: signature, size, route, or header failure
  VERIFIED --> SCHEMA_VALIDATED: registered schema accepted
  VERIFIED --> QUARANTINED_SCHEMA: unknown or malformed payload
  SCHEMA_VALIDATED --> NORMALIZED: pinned adapter/mapping version
  SCHEMA_VALIDATED --> STALE_MAPPING: no current eligible mapping
  NORMALIZED --> QUEUED_FOR_HUMAN_REVIEW: immutable receipt committed
  QUEUED_FOR_HUMAN_REVIEW --> ASSIGNED: qualified reviewer claims
  ASSIGNED --> READY_FOR_DECISION: evidence sufficient
  ASSIGNED --> NEEDS_EVIDENCE: human requests reconciliation
  READY_FOR_DECISION --> CREATED_BY_SEPARATE_HUMAN_COMMAND: create distinct lead succeeds
  READY_FOR_DECISION --> SKIPPED_BY_REVIEWER: human skips or rejects
  READY_FOR_DECISION --> ESCALATED: reconciliation or authorized remap needed
  NEEDS_EVIDENCE --> ESCALATED
  STALE_MAPPING --> ESCALATED
  ESCALATED --> QUEUED_FOR_HUMAN_REVIEW: authorized replay opens new attempt
  QUEUED_FOR_HUMAN_REVIEW --> DEAD_LETTER: durable exception policy
  RECEIVED --> DUPLICATE_REPLAY: same event identity and digest
  RECEIVED --> IDENTITY_CONFLICT: same event identity, different digest

  note right of CREATED_BY_SEPARATE_HUMAN_COMMAND
    Not automatic.
    No merge, consent, message, trial,
    follow-up, enrollment, billing, or AI effect.
  end note
